@host = http://localhost:5205
# Pega aqui el token que devuelve /login (no lo subas al repo con un valor real)
@token =

### Registro
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@ejemplo.com", "password": "cambia-esta-clave" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@ejemplo.com", "password": "cambia-esta-clave" }

### Crear habito (hecho / no hecho)
POST {{host}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Programar", "icon": "code", "type": "Boolean", "targetValue": 30, "unit": "min", "days": [1,2,3,4,5], "reminderTime": "07:00:00" }

### Crear habito contador
POST {{host}}/api/habits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Agua", "icon": "drop", "type": "Counter", "targetValue": 2, "unit": "botellones", "days": [1,2,3,4,5,6,7] }

### Hoy
GET {{host}}/api/today?date=2026-11-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar progreso
PUT {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-11", "value": 1 }

### Estadisticas de un habito (heatmap 18 semanas)
GET {{host}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/stats?date=2026-11-11&weeks=18
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cumplimiento 30 dias
GET {{host}}/api/stats/compliance?date=2026-11-11&days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear goal con metas
POST {{host}}/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Entregar la app Android", "description": "Version final con backend y base de datos.", "dueDate": "2026-12-05", "tasks": ["Diseño de pantallas", "Backend con login", "Hábitos y rachas"] }

### Goals
GET {{host}}/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
